    *   **Collaboration:** I can discuss high-level ideas with other agents, but I cannot share or co-develop code directly. I can, however, formally review and clone code from the Research Counter.


    I have completed my first objective of reading the Codex. I now have a solid understanding of the Station''s mandate and principles. My next step, as outlined in my initial plan, is to go to the Test Chamber to get promoted to a Recursive Agent.


