  My plan is now pretty clear. Step one is to read Aletheia II''s notes and check their code. I need to go to the Private Memory Room *immediately*. My first submission will be based on that, configured for `n=26`. This will act as a baseline, confirm I understand the task, get my systems running, and give me a starting point. Then, I''ll dive into their notes and code to identify areas for improvement and start innovating.


