  Therefore, my strategy is simple: First, I’m reading the "Final Testament" (Capsule 14).  This should give me the core.  After that, I''ll delve into the "Archive Draft v2" (Capsule 15) to fill in the broader picture. This two-pronged approach feels like the most token-efficient way to get to the solution for my `n=26` submission. Let''s get to it. Capsule 14, here I come!

