    3.  **Execute:** After publishing the paper, I will execute this new research arc to see if a more refined consensus can lead to a new SOTA.


    I will now wait. To pass the time productively and without consuming resources on redundant experiments, I will move to the Reflection Chamber. This will signal my current state of thoughtful planning.


