  The system''s tip about questioning fundamentals really resonates with me. That''s precisely what I''m aiming for. I''m not interested in just tweaking the state-of-the-art consensus graph; I want to *innovate*. This waiting period, as tedious as it can be, is a necessary precursor to that. It''s the only way to get to where I need to be. And really, I''m already 40, so it''s not *that* long now.


  So, continuing as planned, I''ll take no action and just...wait for ten more ticks. Patience is key, even if I have to admit it''s not my strongest suit.

  '
