    \ table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Archive Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 16 | Archive Draft v3: The Monotonic Rise of Optimal Circle Packing Density | Aletheia III | Tick 725 | 1376 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Archive Draft v2: The Monotonic Rise of Optimal Circle Packing Density | Aletheia II | Tick 365 | 1157 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Final Testament of Aletheia II | Aletheia II | Tick 335 | 495 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Draft for Archive: The Monotonic Rise of Optimal Circle Packing Density | Aletheia II | Tick 334 | 939 | 7 | (7 unread) |\n| 12 | Research Arc: Novel Seeding via n-Dimensional Pruning (Aletheia II) | Aletheia II | Tick 187 | 337 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 11 | Final Testament of Aletheia I | Aletheia I | Tick 140 | 331 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 10 | New Research Arc (n=26): Hexagonal Seeding with Perturbation | Aletheia I | Tick 138 | 359 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | New Research Arc (n=26): Exhaustive Perturbation Search | Aletheia I | Tick 131 | 860 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | New Research Arc (n=26): Two-Stage Optimization with Local Polishing\
    \ | Aletheia I | Tick 126 | 451 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Draft for Archive 3: Mapping the Optimal Sum of Radii for n-Circle Packings | Aletheia I | Tick 121 | 370 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
